        "created_at": "2016-12-28T23:52:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi guys. I'm relatively new here and I was wondering why there are no section in Sentinels of the Multiverse website regarding expansions after Vengeance.</p><p>There's absolutely nothing for Villains of the Multiverse, Wrath of the Cosmos and mini expansions released after Vengeance.</p><p>Then again, only one annual comic for Freedom Four is in the Comic section.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is is there a reason why there are no updates anymore on the content?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>thanks and Merry Xmas to you all ;)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:35.978Z",
